  h1 About
  p This is the about page of the game
  p This is a simple game created with Node.js, Express, and Pug. The game is a simple turn-based combat game where you can create a character, fight monsters, and level up. The game is still in development, but it is playable. The game is open source and can be found on GitHub. Feel free to contribute to the game or use it as a starting point for your own game. 
  p The game is created by Full Combats. You can find more information about the game on the website. 
  p Enjoy the game! 
  p Thanks for playing! 
